  "bodyHash": "6a022c2d4c67b47b",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Header.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Description.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">本模組旨在讓玩家感受中世紀騎士的氛圍。目前，此模組包含大量全新的旗幟圖案、16套盔甲、8種盾牌以及26種武器，其中大多數可使用11種材料製作：木材、石頭、鐵、金、鑽石、地獄合金、鋼（新增）、銅、銀、錫、青銅。這些武器具備特殊屬性，例如射程增加與穿甲效果。此外，本模組為遊戲新增了鋼，且不會與其他模組中的鋼產生衝突。要合成鋼，只需將鐵錠放入高爐即可。透過此模組，你可以將旗幟附著在盔甲或馬甲上（如同盾牌一般），或是添加盔甲裝飾——許多裝飾均可染成任意顏色。設定檔位於&nbsp;<code>config/epicknights</code> 資料夾中。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>擴充套件：<br></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: 擴充套件</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-dark-ages-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: 黑暗時代</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-slavic-armory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: 斯拉夫軍械庫</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-antique-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: 古物傳承</a><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-ores-and-alloys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: 礦石與合金</a><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-artillery-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: 火炮擴充套件</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rk-medieval-boomsticks-and-sharpsticks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遠程騎士：中世紀火器與長矛</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-open-helms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: 開放式頭盔</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>重要提示：OptiFine 1.20 及以上版本會與許多模組（包含本模組）產生顯示錯誤！<br></strong></span>自 7.0 版本起，此模組需安裝 Architectury API 與 Cloth Config。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Roadmap.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jLgF2Sp/discord-new-2021-logo-45-D326-F28-C-seeklogo-com.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">若您正在尋找一個使用 Epic Knights 盔甲及其所有擴充套件的歷史模擬伺服器，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agVWxf8VGc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Greatest of Centuries</a> 瀏覽。這是一個派系伺服器，專注於透過各種獨特機制與玩家主導的角色扮演，重現君士坦丁堡陷落期間的衝突。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Compatibilities.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a><strong>：</strong>1.18.2+：支援預設設定。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>：<br>1.20.1 與 1.21.1：支援預設設定</p>\n<p>若要在較舊版本中將 Epic Knights 與 Epic Fight 搭配使用，請依照以下步驟操作：</p>\n<p>1.12.2：從&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 下載 epicfight.cfg，並將其放入 configs 資料夾中。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">1.16.5、1.18.2、1.19.2：從 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 下載資料包，解壓縮後依照此教學操作：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fTutorials%252fInstalling%252f_a%252f_data%252f_pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.fandom.com/wiki/Tutorials/Installing_a_data_pack</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">32x32 資源包</a> Reymecos 精心打造了一款極具細節的 32x 資源包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overgeared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overgeared</a>：<br>使用以下資料包使 Overgeared 與 Epic Knights 相容：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-epic-knights-armors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-epic-knights-armors</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-x-epic-knights-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-x-epic-knights-weapons</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Armor.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/478/sprite-0001-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3600\" height=\"3600\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Weapons.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1022/118/weapons-and-shield.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Designs.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/397/342/2021-09-26_19.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Screenshot.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"1243\"></strong>發現任何錯誤請務必回報給我！&nbsp;是的，您可以將其用於發布在 CurseForge 與 Modrinth 上的整合包。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
